  "P29": "in the normal form of Theorem 14.6 of Biss, Dugger and Isaksen the operator J_k preserves the kernel, squares to -I there and commutes with all 31 compressions at alpha = 2, 2k (dim A = 4) and alpha = 2i, 1 + i, i + k (dim A = 2)",
